  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ライモンシティの　ゆうえんちで\nひろった　ライブキャスター。\nおとしぬしは　おとこのこ　らしい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "뇌문시티의 유원지에서\n주운 라이브캐스터.\n잃어버린 사람은 남자인 것 같다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在雷文市的遊樂園裡\n撿到的即時通訊器。\n失主好像是個男孩子。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un Vokit trouvé au parc d’attractions de Méanville.\nC’est un modèle pour garçons.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Viso-Caster, der im Vergnügungspark von\nRayono City gefunden wurde. Er scheint einem\nJungen zu gehören.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Videomisor encontrado en el parque de\natracciones de Ciudad Mayólica. Parece que\npertenece a un chico.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Interpoké rinvenuto nel parco giochi di Sciroccopoli.\nPare che appartenga a un ragazzo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The Xtransceiver found at the Nimbasa City\namusement park. It seems it belongs to a boy.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ライモンシティの　遊園地で\n拾った　ライブキャスター。\n落とし主は　男の子らしい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
